          "content": "<p>一个国外网友想要一个可以躺着用的电脑椅，可以同时观看三台显示器。</p>\n<p>这种电脑椅都非常贵，他就决定自己动手做。</p>\n<p>他先找了一张躺椅，加装了搁脚的脚凳。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202309/bg2023091001.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>然后，又用木架安装了操作台和显示器支架。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202309/bg2023091002.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>最后，装上显示器。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202309/bg2023091003.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>下面就是成品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202309/bg2023091004.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
